The golem automatically reconfigures heavy mail and massive armours designed for living creatures to protect its own vital areas.

[Decreases, Decreases, Increases, Increases, Increases (TL1-5)] armour value by [-2, -1, 0, 1, 2 (TL1-5)], armour hardiness by [-10%, -5%, 0%, 5%, 10% (TL1-5)], and provides [-3%, -1%, 0%, 1%, 3% (TL1-5)] critical hit reduction when wearing heavy mail or massive armour.
